        "title": "Override dei metodi",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponiamo di creare un semplice gioco arcade con un nemico di base e un nemico boss più resistente. I boss sono nemici speciali con un comportamento diverso.</p><p>È qui che entra in gioco l'<strong>override dei metodi</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo creare una classe <code>Enemy</code> e fare in modo che una classe <code>Boss</code> la estenda.</p><p>Quindi, usando l'override dei metodi, possiamo modificare il comportamento del danno della classe <code>Boss</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'override di un metodo sostituisce il codice del metodo nella superclasse con quello della sottoclasse.</p><p>Chiama il metodo <code>takeHit()</code> della classe <code>Boss</code> per vedere cosa succede alla proprietà <code>hp</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>boss</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>takeHit()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per sovrascrivere un metodo, gli assegniamo lo <em>stesso</em> nome e gli stessi parametri del metodo nella superclasse.</p><p>Possiamo sovrascrivere <code>takeHit()</code> dalla superclasse definendo lo stesso metodo nella sottoclasse.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La sovrascrittura significa che possiamo avere lo <em>stesso metodo</em> nella sottoclasse, ma <em>personalizzarne</em> il comportamento in base a ciò che serve nella sottoclasse.</p><p>Quando chiamiamo il metodo <code>takeHit()</code> su <code>enemy</code> e <code>boss</code>, vedremo un comportamento simile ma risultati diversi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"238\" /><option startIndex=\"239\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"308\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"313\" endIndex=\"322\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemy</code>, seguito da <code>takeHit()</code> e poi <code>boss</code>, <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se ci serve il comportamento del metodo della superclasse, possiamo chiamarlo con la parola chiave <code>super</code>.</p><p>Scrivi la parola chiave corretta per chiamare il metodo <code>attack()</code> della classe Enemy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"196\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando esegui l'override, puoi basarti sul comportamento della sottoclasse. Dopo aver eseguito un attacco normale, un boss può attivare una mossa speciale.</p><p>Aggiungi un comportamento specifico del boss al metodo <code>attack()</code> della classe <code>Boss</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"220\" /><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"243\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss uses Mega Slam!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log</code>, seguito da <code>\"Boss uses Mega Slam!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché potremmo voler fare in modo che un metodo in una sottoclasse esegua l'override di un metodo della superclasse?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per personalizzare il metodo nella sottoclasse</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per cambiare il metodo della superclasse per le sottoclassi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per personalizzare il metodo nella sottoclasse.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa deve avere in comune il metodo della sottoclasse con il metodo della superclasse quando lo sovrascrive?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il nome e i parametri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il corpo del metodo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il nome e i parametri.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il metodo nella classe <code>Bat</code> esegue l'override del metodo della classe <code>Enemy</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Bat\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bite(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (target === \" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, ha un nome diverso</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, ha lo stesso parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, ha un nome diverso.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale parola chiave usiamo quando chiamiamo un metodo della superclasse nella sottoclasse?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>this</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una sottoclasse può ancora usare il metodo originale della superclasse, dopo averlo sovrascritto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, quando chiama quel metodo usando il suo nome senza <code>super</code>, la sottoclasse userà il metodo che esegue l'override</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, la sottoclasse usa per impostazione predefinita il metodo della superclasse, anche dopo l'override</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, quando chiama quel metodo usando il suo nome senza <code>super</code>, la sottoclasse userà il metodo che esegue l'override.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui l'override di <code>draw()</code> della superclasse definendo lo stesso metodo nella sottoclasse.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>draw</code>, seguito da <code>()</code> e poi <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 150046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama il metodo <code>draw()</code> sull'istanza <code>AnimatedSprite</code> per vedere cosa succede.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"215\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mySprite = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mySprite.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>mySprite.draw()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 150047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama il metodo <code>draw()</code> su <code>sprite1</code> e <code>sprite2</code> per vedere il loro comportamento diverso.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"198\" /><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"245\" endIndex=\"252\" /><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"260\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Sprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite2.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sprite1</code>, seguito da <code>.draw();</code> e poi <code>sprite2</code>, <code>.draw();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 150048,
